Auth request returned HTTP 411 (Bad Request / Length Required).

Current generated Java incorrectly assumes success and tries XML parsing on HTML error response, causing SAXParseException.

Fixes required:

1. Validate HTTP status before parsing/decrypting response.
2. Mark LR transaction FAIL for non-200 responses.
3. Log raw response body for failures.
4. Investigate auth request construction for missing Content-Length / malformed payload / wrong content type.
